@startuml 02-runtime-step
!pragma layout smetana
' 运行时责任 1/4：脚本执行步进与调用栈
' 来源：GameProc/script_runner.h, execution_engine.h, process_state.h

title 运行时：脚本执行步进

package "GameProc" {
  class EraEngine {
    - m_executionEngine : ExecutionEngine
    - m_scriptRunner : ScriptRunner
    - m_processState : ProcessState
  }

  class ExecutionEngine {
    + executeScript(scriptName) : bool
    + executeLogicalLine(line)
    + executeInstruction(line, scope) : bool
    + setParseTable(table)
    + consumePrintWaitKey() : bool
    .. 输出信号 ..
    .. consolePrint / requestAnyKey ..
  }

  class ScriptRunner {
    - m_table : EraParseTable*
    - m_engine : ExecutionEngine*
    - m_state : ProcessState*
    - m_loops : QList<LoopFrame>
    + runToCompletion() : ExecState
    + runSlice(instructionBudget, timeBudgetMs) : ExecState
    - stepOnce() : bool
    - executeLine(line) : ExecState
    - doCallLine(line, ...) : ExecState
    - returnFromCall() : bool
    .. suspended(state) ..
    .. instructionExecuted(script, line) ..
    .. finished() / errorOccurred(message) ..
  }

  class ProcessState {
    + getExecState() : ExecState
    + requestResume()
    + requestWaitInput()
    + requestWaitSystemInput()
    + intoFunction(label, position)
    + returnF()
    + currentMin() : int
    + functionCount() : int
    .. execStateChanged(state) ..
    .. continueExecution() ..
  }

  struct LoopFrame {
    kind : Repeat | For | While | Do
    startLine / endLine : int
    script : QString
    value / end / step : qint64
    iterations : qint64
  }
}

class ExecState <<enum>> {
  Continue
  WaitInput
  WaitSystemInput
  WaitEvent
  Halt
  Error
}

class EraParseTable
class VariableStorage

EraEngine *-- ExecutionEngine
EraEngine *-- ScriptRunner
EraEngine *-- ProcessState
ScriptRunner --> ExecutionEngine : execute instruction
ScriptRunner --> EraParseTable : current logical line
ScriptRunner --> VariableStorage : explicit scope access
ScriptRunner --> ProcessState : read / request state
ScriptRunner *-- LoopFrame
ProcessState --> ExecState
ProcessState ..> ScriptRunner : continueExecution()
ScriptRunner ..> ProcessState : suspended / finished
ExecutionEngine ..> ScriptRunner : script execution service

note right of ScriptRunner
  一个 slice 只推进当前调用帧。
  CALL / CALLFORM 压入帧，RETURN 弹出帧；
  JUMP 改变当前位置但不新建返回帧。
  runSlice() 在 Continue 之外立即交还控制权，
  由 ProcessState 的恢复信号重新进入执行链。
end note

note bottom of EraEngine
  EraEngine 负责装配对象和信号连接；
  ScriptRunner 负责步进，ExecutionEngine 负责指令语义，
  ProcessState 只保存执行/调用上下文。
end note

legend bottom
  不在本图描述系统状态处理、QML 展示或存档；它们分别见
  03-runtime-system、04-runtime-console-qml、05-runtime-save-load。
endlegend
@enduml
